From 3e2bfb8a930a0a0600d5f5ac59f403462606011b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Apr 2026 15:18:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 458/572] fix(stm32mp2): check core_id in stm32mp_state_set

Check that the core_id parameter passed to stm32mp_state_set is below
PLATFORM_CORE_COUNT, else there will be an overflow of the
stm32_percpu_data table. This should never happen as core_id is always
given by reading MPIDR_AFFLVL0.
This was found by Coverity: Defect (overrun logic_error)

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git f6f1dc8075b3e3dd9bc90ad8085eff63308ccebc fix(stm32mp2): check core_id in stm32mp_state_set]
Change-Id: I2150ecfa970f93be6ae6b2ec473d1c08961f62ac
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/554739
Reviewed-by: Maxime MERE <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
---
 plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_pm.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_pm.c b/plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_pm.c
index 923f1bd8c2..7cbaddcb6c 100644
--- a/plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_pm.c
+++ b/plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_pm.c
@@ -202,6 +202,10 @@ static void stm32mp_state_set(unsigned int core_id, unsigned int state_id, bool
 {
 	bool spin_lock_available = stm32mp_lock_available();
 
+	if (core_id >= PLATFORM_CORE_COUNT) {
+		panic();
+	}
+
 	if (spin_lock_available) {
 		spin_lock(&stm32mp_state_lock);
 	}
-- 
2.53.0

